L["Archmage Vargoth has vanished. Khadgar leads the search through his retreat, but a darker threat lurks behind his disappearance."] = "Erzmagier Vargoth ist verschwunden. Khadgar leitet die Suche in seinem Refugium, doch hinter seinem Verschwinden lauert eine finstere Bedrohung."
